# Nene Engine

Nene Engine is an inhouse game engine named after Sakura Nene's game engine in anime series [<<New Game!!>>](http://newgame-anime.com/).




## Getting Start

### Preliminary

Nene Engine use Python as main scripting language and toolchain language. The following Python must be satisfied:

- Python >= 3.10
- Pyside2 == 5.15.2

Note that Nene Engine use Visual Studio's Project file  ( instead of CMake ) as a primary way to organize the source files. The following C++ environment should be satisficed in Windows:

- Visual Studio >= 2022
- Compiler C++ Standard >= C++20 ( MSVC >= 143 ) 

Currently Nene Engine only supports Microsoft Windows1* with Direct3D 12. Apple's  *OS with Metal 2, Linux with Vulkan will be supported future.



